### Task: LF-100 — split `services/decision-log.service.ts` (468L, 18-symbol API)

The file exports **18 symbols total: 14 types + 1 stateful class (`DecisionLogService`) + 3 factory functions**. The class is stateful (holds buffered entries, flush timers, sinks), so it must **not** be decomposed — it lives whole in `core.ts`. The 14 types and 3 factories are hoisted into their own modules.

**1. The file is reduced to a 1-line shim** — path/import identity preserved, so all importers (`import { DecisionLogService } from "../services/decision-log.service.js"`) keep working with **zero changes**:

```ts
// services/decision-log.service.ts  (was 468 lines, now 1)
export * from "./decision-log.service/index.js";
```

