### LF-101 (dispatched): `api/routes/import.ts` (465L) — default-export router variant

A single-symbol file exporting a default Express router **must NOT** use `export *` (that re-exports nothing but breaks the default). Use the explicit default passthrough:

```ts
// api/routes/import.ts  (was 465 lines, now 1)
export { default } from "./import/index.js";
```

